Package: drumee-node-runtime
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nodejs (>= 22)
Description: Pinned global Node modules for Drumee roles
 The process supervisor (pm2) and the handful of Node modules Drumee's roles
 expect to find installed globally, packaged so the set is versioned, reviewed
 and rolled back like every other component.
 .
 This replaces an unpinned "npm install -g" in the image build, which resolved to
 whatever was newest at build time and left no record of what was installed. The
 versions here are locked by a committed package-lock.json and materialised with
 "npm ci", so two builds of the same package version contain the same modules.
 .
 Architecture: all is correct and verified rather than assumed: the payload is
 pure JavaScript, and build.sh refuses to package it if a compiled object appears
 — see debian/arch-independent-payload.
